export anchor MetricWallStyle:
    number: 183
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Metric wall
    idea: A navy monochrome scoreboard, where eight large figures, four given and four derived, fill a two by four wall of ruled cells under a navy band, and the projects and activity follow as compact ruled lists.
    base: light
    palette:
        navy: #13294b, the band, text, figures, status shapes, the overdue cell and focus
        navy2: #22416f, the search field on the band
        mid: #4a5d7c, labels, notes and field edges
        soft: #7f93b2, last week bars and the search edge, never text
        line: #c6d0df, wall cell rules and list rules
        pale: #e4e9f2, progress tracks
        wash: #f3f5f9, derived cells and the style sheet
        onNavy: #c9d5e8, secondary text on navy
        white: #ffffff, the page and given cells
    type:
        One stack, SF Pro Display, Segoe UI Variable Display, Segoe UI,
        system-ui, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial, with tabular figures.
        Wall figures 64px at 250 weight with minus 0.03em tracking and
        units at 28px, the greeting 30px light with the name at 650, row
        names 14px at 650, notes 13px, labels 11px bold caps tracked 0.12
        to 0.14em.
    layout:
        A 60px navy band holds a four square mark with the brand in spaced
        caps, six text nav links with a white underline under Home, and at
        right a navy search field, a white New project button, a bell with
        a white dot and an outlined initials square with Mara Okafor. Below
        on white the greeting sits at left in light type, and the date with
        an underlined clock and 4 tasks are overdue sits at right. The wall
        is a four by two grid of square cells ruled in thin lines under a
        2px navy top rule. The first row holds the given figures, Active
        projects 6 with the status mix 4, 1 and 1, Tasks due this week 23,
        Overdue tasks 4 as the one inverted navy cell tagged Act first, and
        Hours logged this week 186 h. The second row holds derived figures
        on a pale wash, each tagged Derived, Completed this week 73 with
        14 mini bars, Week over week up 24 percent, Overall progress 46
        percent with 78 of 170 tasks, and Hours per project 31 h. Below,
        two columns split two to one. Projects is a ruled table sorted by
        days left with name and team, status, a thin bar and percent,
        tasks, due and days left. Activity is a ruled list with caps times
        above each sentence. Section heads are small caps over a 2px navy
        rule. Below 1100px the wall is two by four and the lists stack.
        Below 820px the search and nav wrap into rows in the band and the
        table scrolls inside its section.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20 by 24px cell padding, 40px page gutter, 40px between the wall and the lists.
    density: Low on the wall with eight figures only, then dense ruled lists.
    corners: Square everywhere.
    borders: 2px navy top rules on the wall and section heads, 1px #c6d0df cell and row rules, outlined tags.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Line icons at text size in the band. Status shapes are filled navy,
        a check circle for On track, a triangle with a bang for At risk and
        a crossed square for Behind, and the word is plain for On track,
        italic for At risk and underlined for Behind.
    focus: A 3px navy outline offset 2px, white on the band.
    tone: Terse caps labels with plain notes that say how a derived figure was made.
